From 268b6d7e0a9aa020c395fc7acd3a1bc02def2093 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <a@b.c>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:55:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] P14: RPC hosts opt in to session titles
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Reason: RPC hosts such as the web client and cgsconnect want omp-generated session titles and need the set_title_language command to match the user’s UI language.
Upstream: none.
Remove-when: upstream adds a host opt-in for automatic session title generation and lets hosts set the title language.
